  "text": "Music performed by two people together.\n\nNear to each other in this instruction.\n\nA sweet food made with flour and baked.\n\nRest with the body supported on a seat.\n\nGuide Mara to her dock office for tape.\n\nM161 153q-12-41 31-47 30-4 36 21l-1 26Z\n\nTell Sol when the gathering will start.\n\nThe speaker together with other people.\n\nSomeone’s description of what happened.\n\nMara walks to her dock office for tape.\n\nYou can keep playing without answering.\n\nGrandma prepares to share her own story\n\nA strong cord used to fasten something.\n\nThe strands growing on a person’s head.\n\nPut something in a particular position.\n\nTo exist or to have a particular state.\n\nCarried something to a person or place.\n\nBeyond the inside of a place or object.\n\nAdds emphasis to the word that follows.\n\nAir taken into or let out of the lungs.\n\nPoints to a particular person or thing.\n\nA thin piece cut from something larger.\n\nFollowing a path that avoids an object.\n\nStop and hold something that is moving.\n\nThe sound a person makes when speaking.\n\nMoved into a position and became still.\n\nA place where material has been ripped.\n\nExactly like the one already mentioned.\n\nVisit Sol’s workshop beside the garden.\n\nMade something work again after damage.\n\nUsual or familiar, rather than unusual.\n\nOne of the parts that lets a bird fly.\n\nSaying a question or making a request.\n\nPip is here. Choose the nearby action.\n\nDiscuss another way to share the story\n\nFinish the chapter when you are ready.\n\nAn occasion when people come together.\n\nComplete an activity or reach its end.\n\nPoints to a particular thing or group.\n\nGo to get something and bring it back.\n\nGet to something or stretch toward it.\n\nUp to the time when something happens.\n\nBefore the other time being discussed.\n\nForming a picture or idea in the mind.",
